le_name": "BlindSimulator_Bus.png", "id": "1003437577895913", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391969_1003437581229246_653195394531631588_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3M1jhL7oLx8Q7kNvwHSN6Mf&_nc_oc=AdoblfVXyfWu3kidIIYmCA1zdm-sV_D7JbEkbiq8xOxDAd3T9G_Tcr5a0G7qpELN4KA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8FPD-iUaiGFSdOMnPoIuwBowIN-FY5xAdnUSosRV_XLg&oe=6A2C2ABE"}, {"file_name": "BlindSimulator_Stair.png", "id": "4044188659173246", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391885_4044188662506579_7546195151401081343_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uSMxScxTWAEQ7kNvwEzCDqx&_nc_oc=Adpaxx6t9LG-aTIEhVrZaey8AUqpYUNd8FM1VOxwn1p6Rgx-H2vgSFFUscRiRmvUY-0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8WwSiwxt4zGH53l6Se4WDmydONNy2Fduvhsx2JPowXpw&oe=6A2C231A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Cover_Image.png", "id": "1367209481281777", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473396584_1367209484615110_5666152302652103209_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4FgN5HHmAm0Q7kNvwGXEc_W&_nc_oc=Adr7j0PMhnXu_mN1I6YRdhUVzCDCosLLlKW40jj-tFXs5Ha-zHZ4dqvS34uTeP_VA7k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-__EYJFY5Jv5REDPWpKAypNxAx2Pyj-p3LUU79XlAnMA&oe=6A2C0A46"}, "display_name": "BlindSimulator", "keywords": ["Blind", "Simulator", "Education", "Cane", "Experience"], "long_description": "**'Blind Simulator'** is a VR simulation game that offers a unique perspective by allowing players to experience the world as a blind person.\n\nPlayers begin the game without sight and must rely on a white cane as their only tool to explore their surroundings.\nTapping the cane on the ground creates a sonar effect, which temporarily reveals the shapes and objects in the nearby space.\n\n\n{1483889342761078}\n\n\nOn the journey to a hospital, players use public transportation such as buses and subways, and navigate crowded streets and unfamiliar environments \u2014 all within a fully virtual, safe-to-experience setting.\nThrough this process'**how to sense and understand the world without directly seeing it**'.\n\n\n{2251899381954384}\n\n\nThis game goes beyond a simple simulation \u2014 it conveys the everyday discomforts and fears faced by people with visual impairments.\nIt is designed with an educational purpose and presents a narrative-driven VR experience that resonates with players.\n\n\n{1438988117330894}\n\n\n**Start a new kind of exploration where you learn to \"see without seeing\" \u2014 using sound, vibration, and spatial awareness as your only guides.**\n\n\n{1846104142685848}", "short_description": "Experience the journey of a blind person navigating the world using only sound and touch in immersive VR."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero_Cover_BS.png", "id": "2518919831796602", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499293144_2518919835129935_1413575938524185386_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t8O6HMMarV4Q7kNvwFTlOiu&_nc_oc=AdoGIQ179rq0FhdEyeA9nevLpR51AqwL1w2-AAgm9VLD8MfgOiA9A7T1JERY1tYwyKI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8T4CsoEe3tcvM3Kv3vVyrbMaudht-CzPyrYpsdsNm4_w&oe=6A2C0D61"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Sight_BS.png", "id": "1889382115345316", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623599_1889382118678649_1627841262428749483_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jj-jQjr8i7QQ7kNvwG7vHLx&_nc_oc=AdoAhI1icBBGVp6GOusZ0tZjc5YE69nUTrIL7wJA9kLHGqA7hqfvn2bjkTJbyMPA0ms&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_A9perrGj7iufX9oHP_UUqQgCjRPhDZ16zjeZNtLKWYw&oe=6A2C0CB1"}, {"file_name": "Logo_BS.png", "id": "1282969720083144", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/4